#ASSERT `section 2B names` "amends a primary AAO" `as covered by` `the term Administrative Arrangements Order`
#ASSERT `section 2B names` "revokes a primary AAO and substitutes a new primary AAO" `as covered by` `the term Administrative Arrangements Order`

